tasks.description:
Add testing/scripts/plapi-probe.c, built in CI as i386; it dlopens with the server's bin/ on LD_LIBRARY_PATH and prints PLAPI or a CreateInterface error.

Extend check-package.sh for dual packages:
- both cores and both game-extension flavours present;
- dhooks only as .2.ep1;
- the loader has both exports;
- *.1.ep1 report PLAPI 11 and *.2.ep1 report 14..16;
- every MM-attached extension exports CreateInterface;
- css34-package.json has metamod_binaries and cores.

Optionally extend the probe to CreateInterface_MMS for SM ≥ 1.12 extensions.

For sm11-oldstable, run:
- smoke for SM dual × {MM 1.12, MM 1.10.7} × {centos:7, debian:11, ubuntu:24.04, debian:13}, expecting 'Plugin interface version: 16:14 / SourceHook 5:5' or '11:7 / 4:4' in meta version and SourceMod 1.11.0.6970;
- botplay on both lanes: css34_dhooks_probe must be available=1 with all counters on MM 1.12, and SKIP on MM 1.10.7;
- one Metamod-switch smoke: MM 1.10.7 then MM 1.12 over the same tree, and the reverse.
